{
  "id": "6a7234fa064cc9a4aa534135",
  "title": "RobotoよりUD系フォントのほうが見やすくないか？",
  "created": 1785869564,
  "updated": 1785871309,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa064cc9a4aa534135",
      "text": "RobotoよりUD系フォントのほうが見やすくないか？",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785869811
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375d3",
      "text": "from [2026/08/03]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785869564
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7235160000000000637609",
      "text": "[Summer498.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869591,
      "updated": 1785870017
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7236c00000000000c0ee4f",
      "text": "　なんかフォント変わった？",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785870017,
      "updated": 1785870017
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375d5",
      "text": "　 [https://gyazo.com/81650a901a4b415fdfcfa073c3bb9ca9]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870023
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375d6",
      "text": " \t[\" く]の字形や[\" ド]の大きめの濁点からすると、この和文フォントは多分BIZ UDゴシックですね[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785869664
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375d7",
      "text": " 単に自分がいる環境のフォント分布が変わって気になるだけかもしれない",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785869664
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375d8",
      "text": " 調べるか",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785869664
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375d9",
      "text": " from [settings]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785869664
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375da",
      "text": " \tcode:css",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785869664
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375db",
      "text": " \t .stream{font-family:var(--page-font-family, \"Roboto\", Helvetica, Arial, \"BIZ UD\\30b4\\30b7\\30c3\\30af\", \"BIZ UDGothic\", \"Hiragino Sans\")",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785869664
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375dc",
      "text": " \tこうなってるっぽい",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785869664
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375dd",
      "text": " \t多分 [roboto] が表示されてるね",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785869694
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375de",
      "text": " \tRobotoはWindowsやMacにはデフォルトでインストールされているフォントではない点が少し気になります。最近導入したソフトウェアにバンドルでもされていたのだろうか[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785869664
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375df",
      "text": " UD 系フォントのほうが見やすくないか？",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785869664
    },
    {
      "id": "6a72381b0000000000c0ee56",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785870364,
      "updated": 1785870364
    },
    {
      "id": "6a72381b0000000000c0ee57",
      "text": "[Nrem.icon]読みやすい欧文[UDフォント]って何があるんだろう",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785870364,
      "updated": 1785870411
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375e1",
      "text": "　[Roboto]や[Helvetica]は自分の感覚だと、ダークテーマの本文フォントとしては少し文字が詰まって見えるような気がします",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870697
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375e2",
      "text": "　Interフォントの作者がRobotoをx軸の狭いフォントだと指摘していることを思い出すなどした",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870402
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375e3",
      "text": " 　The birth of Inter https://www.figma.com/blog/the-birth-of-inter/",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870402
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375e4",
      "text": "  > Carmel D.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870402
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375e5",
      "text": "  > What didn't work well with the Roboto backfilled characters?",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870402
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375e6",
      "text": "  > Rasmus A.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870402
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375e7",
      "text": "  > Roboto is more condensed. It's squeezed together a little bit on the X axis. That was a challenge to work around, given a backfill of some Cyrillic and Greek characters, like Omega, for instance.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870402
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375e8",
      "text": " ちなみに自分が個人projectで利用しているフォントです",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870402
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375e9",
      "text": " 　ライトテーマ：[Atkinson Hyperlegible Next]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870402
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375ea",
      "text": " 　　[判読性]は高いものの、[可読性]が微妙かな",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785871309
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375eb",
      "text": " 　　ダークテーマにはあまり向かないように思う。",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870402
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375ec",
      "text": " 　　　第一に標準の線がやや細い。",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870402
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375ed",
      "text": " 　　　第二に、判読性を高めるための細工がダークテーマではよく機能しない（小文字のiの縦棒に追加されたserifなど）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870402
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375ee",
      "text": " 　　　　たとえば、小文字のiのドットと線が繋がっているように見える",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870402
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375ef",
      "text": " 　ダークテーマ：[Inter]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870402
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375f0",
      "text": "  　Robotoに近いx-height、かつ文字幅とカーブの懐にゆとりがある",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870402
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375f1",
      "text": " ダークテーマの場合、線の間隔や字間をやや広いものにしたほうがよいはず",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785871298
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375f2",
      "text": " 　追加のウェブフォントを導入せずともRoboto（またはHelvetica）のtrackingを調整するだけで改善されるような気もします",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870402
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375f3",
      "text": "　https://www.daltonmaag.com/font-library/darkmode.html",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870402
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375f4",
      "text": "　　> [Darkmode]は、現代的なUI向けに設計された、非常に読みやすいヒューマニストサンセリフ書体です。太さやイタリック体といった可変フォント軸により、明確な視覚的階層構造を実現しています。また、Darkmode軸は、光照射錯視を打ち消すことで、テキストと背景のコントラストに関わらず一貫性を保ちます。",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870402
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375f5",
      "text": "  興味深いフォントを見つけた",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870402
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7238850000000000c0ee58",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785870470,
      "updated": 1785870471
    },
    {
      "id": "6a72389b0000000000c0ee59",
      "text": "[UserCSS.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785870492,
      "updated": 1785870499
    },
    {
      "id": "6a72361d0000000000c0ee4c",
      "text": "Roboto（厳密には [Roboto Flex]）の[文字幅]と [grade] を調整する[UserCSS]を書いた[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869854,
      "updated": 1785871277
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375f7",
      "text": " これで少しは読みやすくなるだろうか？",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870003
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375f8",
      "text": " code:style.css",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870003
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375f9",
      "text": "  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto+Flex:opsz,wdth,wght,GRAD,XOPQ,XTRA,YOPQ,YTDE,YTFI,YTLC,YTUC@8..144,106.2,100..1000,-200..150,96,468,79,-203,738,514,712&display=swap');",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870003
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375fa",
      "text": "\t .editor {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870003
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375fb",
      "text": "\t \tfont-family: var(--page-font-family, \"Roboto\", Helvetica, \"Arial\", \"Hiragino Sans\"), sans-serif, var(--icons, AppIcons) !important;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870003
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375fc",
      "text": " \t\t--page-font-family: \"Roboto Flex\", \"Roboto\", Helvetica, \"Arial\", \"Hiragino Sans\";",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870003
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375fd",
      "text": "\t \tfont-stretch: 106.2%;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870003
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375fe",
      "text": "\t \t@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870003
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa00000000006375ff",
      "text": "\t \t\t--page-font-family: \"Roboto Flex\", \"Roboto\", Helvetica, \"Arial\", \"BIZ UDゴシック\", \"BIZ UDGothic\", \"Hiragino Sans\";",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870003
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa0000000000637600",
      "text": "\t \t\tfont-variation-settings: 'GRAD' -20;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870003
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa0000000000637601",
      "text": "\t \t}",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870003
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa0000000000637602",
      "text": "\t }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870003
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7234fa0000000000637603",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869564,
      "updated": 1785870712
    },
    {
      "id": "6a723554000000000063760a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869653,
      "updated": 1785869653
    },
    {
      "id": "6a723554000000000063760b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869653,
      "updated": 1785869653
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7235c6000000000063760e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869767,
      "updated": 1785869767
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7235bb000000000063760c",
      "text": "#2026-08-03",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785869756,
      "updated": 1785869764
    },
    {
      "id": "6a72397b0000000000c0ee5a",
      "text": "#ダークテーマのフォント",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785870715,
      "updated": 1785870723
    }
  ]
}